HYP-3459 COLORING/DISCREPANCY BRIDGE FOR LRC14
============================================================================
status=SYNTHESIS / exact AP84 color-quotient audit; not an LRC14 proof
source=prior coloring/discrepancy work + HYP-3438 + HYP-3441 + HYP-3456/HYP-3457

A. Prior coloring hooks being connected
  centered edge variable: s_e=A_e-1/2 is the pair-first color coordinate
  W-polynomial: Hamiltonian paths are sums over products of those colors
  distance-graph LRC: a time is a regular circular coloring of G(Z,D)
  colored discrepancy: CRT counts need one layer for each residue color
  Haar zipper: a margin quotient must retain the local zeta side-channel
  Paris-Harrington miniature: a color is live only with extension rank

